  D557  96 17      LDAA  PORT6          ; N17
  D559  85 20      BITA  #$20           ; closed?
  D55B  26 22      BNE   loc_D57F       ; yes — open
  D55D  B6 C6 C1   LDAA  $C6C1          ; open: close for C6C1 = 10

